; Pixel soul heart (7x6 pixels, 3px each). Skins position it with HeartX/HeartY.

[MeterHeart]
Meter=Shape
X=#HeartX#
Y=#HeartY#
Heart=3,0 | LineTo 9,0 | LineTo 9,3 | LineTo 12,3 | LineTo 12,0 | LineTo 18,0 | LineTo 18,3 | LineTo 21,3 | LineTo 21,9 | LineTo 18,9 | LineTo 18,12 | LineTo 15,12 | LineTo 15,15 | LineTo 12,15 | LineTo 12,18 | LineTo 9,18 | LineTo 9,15 | LineTo 6,15 | LineTo 6,12 | LineTo 3,12 | LineTo 3,9 | LineTo 0,9 | LineTo 0,3 | LineTo 3,3 | ClosePath 1
Shape=Path Heart | Fill Color #Soul# | StrokeWidth 0
DynamicVariables=1
